# NOTICE

This project was developed as an independent educational path planning simulator.
The algorithm design and visualization ideas were inspired by PythonRobotics
(https://github.com/AtsushiSakai/PythonRobotics), which is also MIT-licensed.

PythonRobotics Copyright (c) 2016 - now Atsushi Sakai and other contributors.

This project re-implements the A* and RRT algorithms with a reorganized
project structure, and adds features including batch testing, CSV export,
and systematic algorithm comparison that are not present in the original
PythonRobotics demos.

No source code from PythonRobotics was directly copied. All code in this
project was written independently, using algorithmic concepts that are
standard in the robotics literature.
